            "review_text": "Jasper O Waale\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam86 contributions\n0\nTable BBQ, in Q2, with a few issues\nJun 2016 • Family\nAcoustics are bad hard to talk, and they had what sounding like 1980 Vietnam TV as music ? \n\nThey let anybody smoke inside, despite having plenty of outdoor seating ,\nits not that cheap, wine menu was well hidden and selection was embarrassing.\n\nHowever one of the best Udong's I had in Vietnam and Meats and others was good, I go back for sure despite the smoking yes I get the irony of me making complaints of cigarette smoke in a Table BBQ place, but its not legal in Vietnam and not something I seek out\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 15, 2016",
